<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$30 bln government bonds in Dec.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$30 bln government bonds in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's finance ministry said on Thursday it would issue more than T$30 billion in government bonds in December.</p>
<p>A ministry official told reporters that the bonds would be used to meet payments of some T$40 billion in retirement funds and major construction projects.</p>
<p>The official gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
